| Dose-per-track | TOPAS-MGM scores it per nucleus crossing | Closed form `z = y/(ρπr²)` (paper Eq via `_getZ` in MGM library). |
| Validation runs | Cell-layer mono-energetic beams + water phantom Bragg curves + ²¹¹At/²²⁵Ac RPT, ≥10⁶ primaries | NOT REPRODUCED — extension code unavailable. |
